            <ArticleTitle>Vulvodynia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>522-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Vulvar pain and discomfort are common conditions which can truly make the patient's life miserable. It is relatively common, but can be a difficult condition to evaluate and treat. This article serves to give the primary care physician a basic framework with which to begin treatment for such patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
